11
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:39,480
Selesai!

12
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:41,203
Event pertama sudah masuk.

13
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:48,406
Tracking jalan dulu, baru
tambah platform iklan.

14
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,338
Panduannya, di konektor.id.
